WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A rubber hand can look convincingly real. What does that prove?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A 1998 study paired sight and touch under controlled conditions.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
It did not test meditation products or promise identical experiences.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Later research examined expectations and testing order.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
A vivid experience is not proof of its proposed explanation.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Investigate evidence, try a free baseline, review actual offer terms.
